<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>DQ Sheet Cake — When to Order It</h2>
  <p>The DQ Sheet Cake is the right choice when your group is too large for a 10-inch round. It serves 24–32 people, making it ideal for office parties, school events, large family gatherings, graduation celebrations, and any event where 12–16 portions would not be enough. Find the full DQ cake lineup on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a> or the <a href="/categories/dq-cakes">DQ Cakes category page</a>.</p>
  <h2>DQ Cake Size Comparison</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>DQ Cake</th><th>Price</th><th>Serves</th><th>Format</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>8-inch Round</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$22.99+</td><td>8–10</td><td>Round</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>10-inch Round</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$32.99+</td><td>12–16</td><td>Round</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Oreo® Blizzard® Cake</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$38.74+</td><td>12–16</td><td>Round, Oreo throughout</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Sheet Cake</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$44.99+</td><td>24–32</td><td>Rectangular</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>How to Order the DQ Sheet Cake</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Call or visit your DQ location</strong> at least 48 hours before your event — more for very large orders</li>
    <li><strong>Specify Sheet Cake</strong> and the date/time you need it</li>
    <li><strong>Add your personalized message</strong> — included at no extra charge</li>
    <li><strong>Ask about cutting services</strong> — some locations will pre-cut the sheet cake for you</li>
    <li><strong>Bring a large insulated bag</strong> or cooler for transport — the sheet cake is larger than the round cakes and requires proper cold transport</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Related Items</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/dq-cake-round-8inch">Classic DQ Cake 8-inch — $22.99+</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/oreo-blizzard-cake">Oreo® Blizzard® Cake — $38.74+</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/dq-cakes">All DQ Cake Options</a></li>
  </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is the DQ Sheet Cake?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">$44.99+ and serves 24–32 people. Price may vary by location.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How far in advance do I need to order a DQ Sheet Cake?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">At least 48 hours in advance. For large events or peak seasons like summer, more notice is recommended.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Does the DQ Sheet Cake come in Blizzard flavors?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The Sheet Cake is available in the classic DQ soft serve flavor. Blizzard Cake formats (Oreo, Cookie Dough, etc.) are typically available in 10-inch round only. Confirm with your local DQ.</div></div>
      </div></div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">
      For the complete 2026 DQ food and treats menu, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Dairy Queen Menu</strong></a>.
      See all Blizzard flavors on the <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard Treats</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>
